  vendorName: Engineer Montgomery
  offerText: Fund my experimental weather machine! It will completely dominate your
    living room, but the scientific prestige will make you endlessly happy.
  acceptResultText: You fund the project. The massive machine just spews black smoke
    and makes a deafening racket, giving you a terrible headache and ruining your
    day.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to fund mad science. Your room stays quiet and your
    money stays safe.
  acceptedDelayedText: A rival technology firm buys out Montgomery's patent and forcibly
    acquires the noisy prototype from your room, paying you a massive compensation
    fee!
  rejectedDelayedText: 'You read the paper: Montgomery''s machine successfully altered
    the climate and made his investors billionaires. You missed out entirely and
    feel sick with regret.'
